# BuildKit picks this up automatically for `-f apps/context-passport/Dockerfile`
# (per-Dockerfile ignore file), so the repo-root build context holds only the
# two workspaces the image compiles: context-passport itself, and the five
# apps/mint crates mint-protocol path-depends on (mint-protocol, mint-core,
# mint-store, mint-receipts, mint-ledger).
*
!apps/context-passport/Cargo.toml
!apps/context-passport/Cargo.lock
!apps/context-passport/crates
!apps/mint/Cargo.toml
!apps/mint/Cargo.lock
!apps/mint/crates/mint-core
!apps/mint/crates/mint-store
!apps/mint/crates/mint-receipts
!apps/mint/crates/mint-ledger
!apps/mint/crates/mint-protocol
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.env*
